' STAY THERE on another player's ground (`preset classic ai amiga seed 16
' players A,B party`: A starts with one companion handed over, a prepared
' state; B camps a man at Stove Vent as in v12_doors). v1.2's
' `OnMenuMakeCamp` (LocationScene.cs:1164-1180) opens the Capture
' conversation there (`Dialog.GetCaptureConversation`, Dialog.cs:80-99):
' `men_500` section 3 and one answer, "burn?490", which closes it. Nothing
' else changes: the companion is still with A (the HUD still shows 1/2) and
' B still holds the place.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 354,317         ' A sets out for Stove Vent: two days
wait 20
mapclick 354,317         ' B, at Stove Vent, walks in
wait 60
clickon 228              ' and hires a man
hire
wait 20
join                     ' who holds the place for B
wait 10
day
wait 30
day
wait 30
mapclick 354,317         ' A, arrived, walks in
wait 80
save
join                     ' STAY THERE: the Capture dialog
wait 5
snap capture
talkline 0               ' "( continue... )": the rest of the text
wait 5
snap capture_answer
talkline 2               ' its one answer: closed
wait 5
snap capture_closed
quit
